---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecutionDB as Execution DB

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo run create
    activate Vigilo

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load and parse profile and dataset inputs
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Canonicalize payloads and validate dataset
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Validate profile executability
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Runnable evaluator summary

    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Plan case blobs, dataset version, run, chunks, placements, and dispatch cursors
    Vigilo->>ControlDB: Store run metadata, placement rows, cursors, and canonical dataset rows
    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Store execution-local prerequisites and pending chunks

    alt Run creation committed
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Control records saved
        ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Execution seed rows saved
        Vigilo->>Vigilo: Build run creation payload
        Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    else Validation or persistence fails
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Error
        Vigilo-->>User: Run creation error
    end

    deactivate Vigilo
